I open my door.
I am standing in the stairwell.
It is quiet.
A door opens.
A woman smiles at me.
"Hi," she says.
"What is your name?" she asks.
"My name is Maya," I answer.
"Where do you come from?" she asks.
"I come from Mexico," I say.
"Welcome to Denmark," the woman says.
"My name is Nina," she says.
"I am your neighbour."
Nina is very friendly.
There is a smile on her face.
"Here is my door," she says.
"I am happy to help."
"You just knock," Nina says.
"Thank you very much, Nina," I answer.
I am very happy.
Now I have a friend in Copenhagen.
